              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbere n’abaherezi bakuru‐bakuru bose bo n’abantu bāgize ivy’ ubuhemu bginshi, bakaja mu vy’ibizira vyose vy’ubuyobe vy’abanyamahanga, bakanduza ingoro y’Uhoraho, iyo Uhoraho ubgiwe yari yarejeje i Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.14",
