        {
          "text": "Ariko bagashinyagurira izo ntumwa z’Imana, bagakēngēra amajambo yayo, bagatwenga abo yavugisha, gushitsa ah’uburake bg’Uhoraho bgabaye ku bantu biwe, butagishobora kugarurwa. ",
