            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kand’ ibintu vyose vyo mu ngoro y’Imana, ibito‐bito n’ibinini‐binini, bo n’ivy’ ubutunzi vyo mur’ iyo ngoro nyene y’Uhoraho, n’ivy’ ubutunzi vy’umwami n’ivy’ abaganwa biwe, ivyo vyose abijana i Babuloni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.18",
